# M12: the Save changes question on the 50-row screen: Yes has the focus, then Cancel with Left.
@rows 50
@copy plain.qld
@open PLAIN.QLD
x
f10 end enter                     # File > Exit asks to save
left                              # Cancel (the focus wraps)
esc                               # back to the document
f10 end enter
n                                 # No: exit without saving
